  <h1>The Mystery of the Traditional Scavenger Hunt </h1>
  <p><em>The true fans (you know, the ones with the Hardy Boys<sup><span class="small">TM</span></sup> lunchboxes, the Nancy Drew-brand plaid leg warmers, and the Three Investigators German editions) don't know just the popular stories, they know all of them, all
    the way back to the beginning.</em></p>
  <p>You must bring us 100 points worth of items, determined as follows:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>10 items from a column = 25 points</li>
    <li>15 items from a column = 40 points</li>
    <li>20 items from a column = 60 points</li>
    <li>Three items from a given row = 10 bonus points</li>
    </ul>
  <p>Drawings and photographs are not acceptable.</p>
